WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.630 --> 00:00:04.640
Jinwoo...

2
00:00:04.720 --> 00:00:07.430
You know you've changed. a lot.

3
00:00:07.510 --> 00:00:10.720
And then there's me who
hasn't really changed at all.

4
00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:13.010
Well. everyone's different.

5
00:00:13.090 --> 00:00:16.440
I changed a lot because
a lot's happened.

6
00:00:16.520 --> 00:00:19.150
Yeah. very true.

7
00:00:19.230 --> 00:00:21.730
There's one thing I can
finally admit. though.

8
00:00:21.810 --> 00:00:23.860
I'm too timid for this job.

9
00:00:23.940 --> 00:00:26.580
I had hoped I'd overcome that. but...

10
00:00:26.660 --> 00:00:28.430
I just couldn't.

11
00:00:30.160 --> 00:00:32.740
I should've been signing up
for A and B-Rank dungeons.

12
00:00:32.820 --> 00:00:35.920
or if not those. then maybe
at least some C-Rank ones.

13
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:39.190
I knew that. but I purposely
stuck with the D and E-ranks.

14
00:00:40.670 --> 00:00:43.250
Those low-ranked raids
were how I met you. though.

15
00:00:43.330 --> 00:00:46.780
and how I found myself
healing you over and over again.

16
00:00:48.130 --> 00:00:52.100
At first. I was a little annoyed
by how often you got hurt.

17
00:00:52.180 --> 00:00:54.300
Yet somehow you always survived.

18
00:00:54.380 --> 00:00:56.360
You got back up and kept fighting.

19
00:00:56.440 --> 00:00:59.380
That passionate fire in your
eyes never flickered out.

20
00:01:00.190 --> 00:01:02.350
In fact. it's burned in my mind.

21
00:01:03.730 --> 00:01:06.990
We promised that we would
go out to eat somewhere.

22
00:01:07.070 --> 00:01:09.620
But. you should have this back.

23
00:01:09.700 --> 00:01:11.570
Hm... can I know why?

24
00:01:11.650 --> 00:01:15.440
'Cause I'm leaving.
I'm retiring as a hunter.

25
00:01:17.210 --> 00:01:19.210
Yeah. I'm moving back home.

26
00:01:19.290 --> 00:01:22.670
So give me a heads up if you're ever
in the area and I'll show you around.

27
00:01:22.750 --> 00:01:24.520
For old times'.

28
00:01:26.670 --> 00:01:29.890
Fair enough. When that happens.
I'll cash in our rain check.

29
00:01:29.970 --> 00:01:31.870
Sure.

30
00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:39.074
Watch Online Movies and Series for FREE
www.osdb.link/lm

31
00:01:47.570 --> 00:01:52.030
Frankly. I don't see an E-Rank like
you having a hand in Taeshik's defeat.

32
00:01:52.110 --> 00:01:56.080
I was the one who tested you for
a potential reawakening. after all.

33
00:01:56.160 --> 00:01:58.900
But I do feel compelled
to give you a warning.

34
00:01:59.700 --> 00:02:02.500
If you want to live
a long life. then be careful.

35
00:02:02.580 --> 00:02:04.250
What do you mean?

36
00:02:04.330 --> 00:02:08.090
You survived when Dongsuk Hwang's
strike team was wiped out too.

37
00:02:08.170 --> 00:02:11.180
You and that D-Rank may have
painted targets on your backs.

38
00:02:11.260 --> 00:02:14.940
Because it just so happens that
Dongsuk's brother is Dongsoo Hwang.

39
00:02:15.020 --> 00:02:17.580
If he isn't after you two.
I would be shocked.

40
00:02:18.720 --> 00:02:21.140
You mean Dongsoo Hwang
as in the S-Rank?

41
00:02:21.220 --> 00:02:23.230
-For real?
-Yes.

42
00:02:23.310 --> 00:02:25.740
What actually happened
doesn't matter to him.

43
00:02:25.820 --> 00:02:28.320
His only takeaway
is that his brother died.

44
00:02:28.400 --> 00:02:31.360
while you and some other
low-rank made it out alive.

45
00:02:33.030 --> 00:02:35.040
S-Ranks aren't bound by laws.

46
00:02:35.120 --> 00:02:37.210
With that much power
at their fingertips.

47
00:02:37.290 --> 00:02:41.270
they can choose to bring about
miracles. or absolute destruction.

48
00:02:42.160 --> 00:02:47.470
So one of the monsters that even monsters
fear is out for your blood. Jinwoo Sung.

49
00:02:47.550 --> 00:02:49.200
hence my warning.

50
00:02:50.130 --> 00:02:51.510
If possible.

51
00:02:51.590 --> 00:02:55.460
I suggest you take your family and
leave the country as soon as you can.

52
00:02:58.060 --> 00:03:00.310
One more reason
I need to get stronger.

53
00:03:00.390 --> 00:03:02.310
I have to.

54
00:03:02.390 --> 00:03:06.630
Otherwise...
I won't be able to survive.

55
00:04:39.860 --> 00:04:41.490
Uh. Jinho?

56
00:04:41.570 --> 00:04:44.890
Just one question.
what am I looking at here?

57
00:04:46.080 --> 00:04:49.210
I thought it was obvious.
like what else could it be?

58
00:04:49.290 --> 00:04:51.500
This is our strike team!

59
00:04:51.580 --> 00:04:55.100
When making my selections. I prioritized
people who are registered hunters

60
00:04:55.180 --> 00:04:59.180
but have reasons they can't work and
people who are having trouble getting by.

61
00:04:59.260 --> 00:05:01.720
The injured and drunk made the cut?

62
00:05:01.800 --> 00:05:04.010
It really works better for us.
so yeah!

63
00:05:04.090 --> 00:05:07.480
Can't raid C-Rank gates without
eight people. and these want the cash.

64
00:05:07.560 --> 00:05:08.980
Hm?

65
00:05:09.060 --> 00:05:11.000
Bro. is that a kid?

66
00:05:12.100 --> 00:05:14.780
Minors can raid as long
as they've awakened.

67
00:05:14.860 --> 00:05:17.030
And she has. so it's okay.

68
00:05:17.110 --> 00:05:18.120
'Scuse me.

69
00:05:18.200 --> 00:05:19.280
-Huh?
-Huh?

70
00:05:19.360 --> 00:05:21.030
That's kind of rude.

71
00:05:21.110 --> 00:05:23.390
I'm a qualified hunter. not a kid.

72
00:05:24.200 --> 00:05:26.040
You're in high school. though. right?

73
00:05:26.120 --> 00:05:27.420
You raided before?

74
00:05:27.500 --> 00:05:29.830
Well. n-no.

75
00:05:29.910 --> 00:05:31.560
I'm guessing you're E-Rank?

76
00:05:32.330 --> 00:05:34.500
What's it matter what rank I am?

77
00:05:34.580 --> 00:05:38.030
Touche. It doesn't matter
since you're staying here.

78
00:05:38.670 --> 00:05:41.780
Jinho and I will be the only
ones who go through the gate.

79
00:05:42.800 --> 00:05:46.270
So. you two really wanna
clear this thing by yourselves?

80
00:05:46.350 --> 00:05:49.850
While the rest of us get three million
big ones just for sitting around?

81
00:05:49.930 --> 00:05:52.980
Right. that's three million
for every raid.

82
00:05:53.060 --> 00:05:55.890
Not half bad since you aren't
required to fight. huh?

83
00:05:57.190 --> 00:05:59.610
Catch is. you can't talk about it.

84
00:05:59.690 --> 00:06:02.610
If you go public with our deal.
per the contract.

85
00:06:02.690 --> 00:06:05.420
you'll have to pay us back
ten times what we paid you.

86
00:06:06.370 --> 00:06:09.810
This is the Stealth stone I
got from beating Taeshik Kang.

87
00:06:10.700 --> 00:06:12.440
Might as well use it now.

88
00:06:24.210 --> 00:06:26.770
Nice. looks like it worked.

89
00:06:26.850 --> 00:06:28.510
You ready. boss?

90
00:06:30.720 --> 00:06:32.770
What are you wearing?

91
00:06:32.850 --> 00:06:36.860
This is a full suit of buff-boosting
armor. special-ordered from Italy.

92
00:06:36.940 --> 00:06:40.650
S'a little something I had prepared
once you agreed to raid with me.

93
00:06:40.730 --> 00:06:43.340
And now I'm ready
for whatever trials await!

94
00:06:47.330 --> 00:06:50.330
Not to me mean but you better
take that off before I rip it off.

95
00:06:50.410 --> 00:06:51.960
Okay.

96
00:06:56.170 --> 00:06:58.550
Boss. would you mind helping me up?

97
00:07:02.710 --> 00:07:04.340
Onward!

98
00:07:04.420 --> 00:07:06.430
Gotta admit I'm nervous. though.

99
00:07:06.510 --> 00:07:09.180
Dude. I swear to...
what did I just say?

100
00:07:09.260 --> 00:07:11.180
At least let me keep the helmet!

101
00:07:12.850 --> 00:07:14.680
Fine. whatever.

102
00:07:14.760 --> 00:07:16.380
-Let's go.
-Right!

103
00:07:17.320 --> 00:07:20.400
Should we let them raid it alone?
It feels sorta wrong.

104
00:07:20.480 --> 00:07:24.590
I mean. we warned them and they paid in
advance. so whatever happens happens.

105
00:07:26.620 --> 00:07:30.950
All I know is a C-Rank dungeon isn't
gonna be cleared by a D and an E-Rank.

106
00:07:31.030 --> 00:07:34.430
Those two greenhorns don't have a
damn clue what they're getting into.

107
00:07:40.920 --> 00:07:43.240
Song-yi must be skipping class today.

108
00:07:46.760 --> 00:07:48.430
How long's it been?

109
00:07:48.510 --> 00:07:49.930
I'd say about an hour now?

110
00:07:50.010 --> 00:07:54.330
But it would take a normal squad at
least two hours to clear. so get comfy.

111
00:07:56.690 --> 00:07:59.360
I guess they ran away.
they're lucky to be alive.

112
00:07:59.440 --> 00:08:02.320
I don't think they're leaving
because they're giving up!

113
00:08:02.400 --> 00:08:04.960
Look. the gate's closing!

114
00:08:06.240 --> 00:08:09.160
No. they beat the boss?

115
00:08:09.240 --> 00:08:12.430
-Where's the next gate?
-About an hour from here.

116
00:08:13.200 --> 00:08:15.090
All right. let's get goin'.

117
00:08:15.170 --> 00:08:18.320
We're moving. everyone!
Got two more dungeons to clear!

118
00:08:19.250 --> 00:08:20.250
Ah...

119
00:08:20.330 --> 00:08:24.070
or would you rather leave the other six
million you could earn today on the table?

120
00:08:25.000 --> 00:08:28.450
Are they for real?
Who are these guys?

121
00:08:34.890 --> 00:08:37.190
Hey. I'm done mining all
of the mana crystals over here!

122
00:08:37.270 --> 00:08:40.380
Sounds good.
I had better wrap this up. too.

123
00:08:47.160 --> 00:08:48.490
I'm heading out.

124
00:08:48.570 --> 00:08:50.700
Dude. more work today?

125
00:08:50.780 --> 00:08:53.390
Yep. Don't forget to lock up.

126
00:09:22.190 --> 00:09:24.860
Has he had that skill
this whole time?

127
00:09:24.940 --> 00:09:27.180
Or did he get stronger?

128
00:09:28.110 --> 00:09:31.620
Gotta say. It wasn't fun
earning the stealth skill.

129
00:09:31.700 --> 00:09:33.410
But. man. is it useful.

130
00:09:34.100 --> 00:09:36.750
Fighting's easy when your
opponent can't see you.

131
00:09:40.410 --> 00:09:43.270
Oh. the Dash skill
leveled up. that's cool.

132
00:09:49.380 --> 00:09:53.320
And with my new Advanced
Dagger-Wielding and Fatal Strike skills...

133
00:09:54.970 --> 00:09:57.000
I feel unstoppable!

134
00:09:58.730 --> 00:10:00.400
Awesome job today!

135
00:10:00.480 --> 00:10:02.770
As soon as I snag all the goods
we can be on our way.

136
00:10:02.850 --> 00:10:04.770
You should rest up in the meantime.

137
00:10:04.850 --> 00:10:06.640
Thanks. will do.

138
00:10:07.530 --> 00:10:09.660
My new skills are handy.

139
00:10:09.740 --> 00:10:13.700
Though they'd be a lot handier if I
had the mana to use them longer.

140
00:10:13.780 --> 00:10:17.850
I'll have to put more ability points toward
increasing my intellect going forward.

141
00:10:19.160 --> 00:10:23.310
Should I take this momentum
all the way to the Demon Castle?

142
00:10:25.040 --> 00:10:26.180
No.

143
00:10:26.260 --> 00:10:29.680
I probably fall somewhere
between B and A-Rank as I am now.

144
00:10:29.760 --> 00:10:33.370
I could try taking on
that dungeon. but I dunno.

145
00:10:37.640 --> 00:10:41.080
Wasn't aware there was a target
level I was supposed to be aiming for.

146
00:10:43.640 --> 00:10:45.800
A "job-change quest?"

147
00:10:47.360 --> 00:10:48.700
Manager Ahn!

148
00:10:48.780 --> 00:10:50.650
Look at this!

149
00:10:50.730 --> 00:10:52.820
Whatcha got. Kichul?

150
00:10:52.900 --> 00:10:55.830
A few recent bids for the local
C-Rank dungeon gates.

151
00:10:55.910 --> 00:10:57.580
One hundred fifty million?

152
00:10:57.660 --> 00:11:01.370
Who in their right mind blows that much
money on the permit for a C-Rank gate once

153
00:11:01.450 --> 00:11:03.210
let alone multiple times?

154
00:11:03.290 --> 00:11:04.830
There's a strike team
that's spending nearly

155
00:11:04.910 --> 00:11:07.340
double the market rate
for C-Rank gates around here.

156
00:11:07.420 --> 00:11:10.130
leaving nothing for our guild's
lower-rank hunters.

157
00:11:10.800 --> 00:11:11.970
Who are they?

158
00:11:12.050 --> 00:11:15.640
Never heard of this squad or this
"Jinho Yoo" character that's leading them.

159
00:11:15.720 --> 00:11:18.770
He's the son of Yoojin
Construction's president.

160
00:11:18.850 --> 00:11:20.480
The Yoojin Construction?

161
00:11:20.560 --> 00:11:23.140
Spending like this will
just put them in the red.

162
00:11:23.220 --> 00:11:25.800
Seems excessive for
a rich kid playing hunter.

163
00:11:28.320 --> 00:11:30.400
E-Rank. Jinwoo Sung?

164
00:11:30.480 --> 00:11:33.780
Yes. sir. They threw together
a band of misfits and randos.

165
00:11:33.860 --> 00:11:36.350
It's hard to say
what they're planning.

166
00:11:39.160 --> 00:11:43.120
Is this the same Jinwoo Sung
from the double dungeon incident?

167
00:11:43.200 --> 00:11:45.000
There's something here.

168
00:11:45.080 --> 00:11:46.900
I can smell it.

169
00:11:48.000 --> 00:11:50.340
-You gonna go?
-I'm thinking.

170
00:11:50.420 --> 00:11:51.800
Hey. sorry we're late!

171
00:11:51.880 --> 00:11:53.090
-Huh?
-Huh?

172
00:11:53.170 --> 00:11:54.760
Well. you won't hear me complain.

173
00:11:54.840 --> 00:11:57.060
Besides. you're actually
ahead of schedule.

174
00:11:57.140 --> 00:12:00.720
It took a sec to collect all those crystals.
so I thought we were pressed for time.

175
00:12:00.800 --> 00:12:02.390
But. onto the next!

176
00:12:02.470 --> 00:12:04.470
Man. you've gotta be dead tired.

177
00:12:04.550 --> 00:12:06.050
Want me to drive?

178
00:12:06.730 --> 00:12:09.730
It'd be nice to have
something to do. if it's cool.

179
00:12:09.810 --> 00:12:11.070
Oh. I gotcha...

180
00:12:11.150 --> 00:12:12.610
What?

181
00:12:12.690 --> 00:12:14.130
Nothing.

182
00:12:16.620 --> 00:12:19.910
Sir. you think
Jinwoo Sung reawakened?

183
00:12:19.990 --> 00:12:21.540
That is what I just said.

184
00:12:21.620 --> 00:12:23.580
Anything to base that on?

185
00:12:23.660 --> 00:12:25.670
There have been three huge
disasters recently

186
00:12:25.750 --> 00:12:28.880
that Hunter Sung survived
despite the casualties.

187
00:12:28.960 --> 00:12:31.000
First. the double dungeon.

188
00:12:31.630 --> 00:12:35.350
Second. the annihilation
of Dongsuk Hwang's strike team.

189
00:12:35.430 --> 00:12:39.740
and last but certainly not least. getting
caught in Taeshik Kang's murder spree.

190
00:12:40.550 --> 00:12:43.260
There was just a handful
of survivors for each incident.

191
00:12:43.340 --> 00:12:45.140
and Sung was always among them.

192
00:12:45.220 --> 00:12:48.320
A reawakening is the only
explanation that would make sense.

193
00:12:48.400 --> 00:12:50.960
Well. I guess that's true.

194
00:12:52.020 --> 00:12:55.910
So where are you headed now.
Manager Ahn? To research?

195
00:12:55.990 --> 00:12:57.850
No. Kichul.

196
00:12:58.950 --> 00:13:02.230
There's a promising rookie
out there I'd like to go scout.

197
00:13:05.280 --> 00:13:08.740
There's a plot twist.
What is this. a picnic?

198
00:13:10.870 --> 00:13:12.340
Hi.

199
00:13:12.420 --> 00:13:15.680
And bye. This place
is a restricted area.

200
00:13:15.760 --> 00:13:17.470
Sorry about that.
but we noticed there were

201
00:13:17.550 --> 00:13:21.140
a bunch of hunters hanging out over here.
and couldn't help but take a closer look.

202
00:13:21.220 --> 00:13:25.010
That blue light is a gate. yeah?
Is it okay for you to be this close?

203
00:13:25.090 --> 00:13:28.900
I'm not a kid so stop treating me like
one. You can treat me like a hunter.

204
00:13:28.980 --> 00:13:33.540
Wait. if you're a hunter. then. are you
on the strike team in charge of this gate?

205
00:13:34.730 --> 00:13:37.030
-Yes.
-Uh...

206
00:13:37.110 --> 00:13:38.600
But...

207
00:13:39.570 --> 00:13:41.370
Ha ha. gotcha!

208
00:13:41.450 --> 00:13:44.530
Hunter Sung must be clearing
the dungeon alone as we speak!

209
00:13:44.610 --> 00:13:47.250
If I'm right about this guy.
he could be a big find!

210
00:13:47.330 --> 00:13:49.290
No. bigger than big!

211
00:13:49.370 --> 00:13:52.210
I see. sorry for disturbing you.

212
00:13:52.290 --> 00:13:53.790
You be careful. little lady.

213
00:13:53.870 --> 00:13:56.280
Sir. are we really leaving now?

214
00:13:58.170 --> 00:13:59.510
The captain's back!

215
00:13:59.590 --> 00:14:01.490
Get ready to move out. guys.

216
00:14:04.970 --> 00:14:06.980
Hey. do you have any raids
scheduled for tomorrow?

217
00:14:07.060 --> 00:14:09.980
I remembered there's something
I gotta go do. so can I take off?

218
00:14:10.060 --> 00:14:12.600
Hm. Let's see what I've got here.

219
00:14:12.680 --> 00:14:14.980
Yeah. I reserved a couple.

220
00:14:15.060 --> 00:14:16.660
Want me to cancel?

221
00:14:16.740 --> 00:14:18.200
And waste money?

222
00:14:18.280 --> 00:14:20.570
I know you have it. but still.

223
00:14:20.650 --> 00:14:23.050
I can hold onto them
for another two days.

224
00:14:24.740 --> 00:14:27.290
Okay. in that case. why don't
we go ahead and delay.

225
00:14:27.370 --> 00:14:29.040
Consider them delayed.

226
00:14:29.120 --> 00:14:31.690
I'm sorry about the wait.
c'mon. let's get moving!

227
00:15:06.950 --> 00:15:10.810
That same dream. again.

228
00:15:19.050 --> 00:15:20.950
It's almost time.

229
00:15:24.250 --> 00:15:26.010
See ya later. boss!

230
00:15:28.810 --> 00:15:30.410
Hm?

231
00:15:31.810 --> 00:15:34.580
I apologize if this is sudden.
Hunter Sung.

232
00:15:35.550 --> 00:15:37.940
The name's Sangmin Ahn and
I'm currently the manager

233
00:15:38.020 --> 00:15:40.900
of the Second Administration
Team for the White Tiger Guild.

234
00:15:40.980 --> 00:15:44.250
If you have just a moment to spare.
I'd love to have a word with you.

235
00:15:45.110 --> 00:15:48.120
I'm sure my guild's
reputation precedes itself.

236
00:15:48.200 --> 00:15:51.950
But White Tiger isn't just a great guild.
it's one of the country's best.

237
00:15:52.030 --> 00:15:54.700
And we're always on the lookout
for promising new talent

238
00:15:54.780 --> 00:15:56.570
to help us climb even higher.

239
00:15:57.630 --> 00:16:00.010
Since I know your time
is precious. I'll be direct.

240
00:16:00.090 --> 00:16:03.340
I recognize you're a capable hunter
and I'd like you to join our guild.

241
00:16:03.420 --> 00:16:05.810
We'll pay double what
Yoojin Construction does.

242
00:16:05.890 --> 00:16:07.820
And if you have any
additional conditions.

243
00:16:07.900 --> 00:16:10.930
just let me know and I'm sure
we can arrange to see them met.

244
00:16:11.010 --> 00:16:12.180
How's that?

245
00:16:12.260 --> 00:16:16.570
For someone who was E-Rank a few
short months ago. this is quite the bargain!

246
00:16:16.650 --> 00:16:18.590
He's bound to say yes!

247
00:16:19.810 --> 00:16:23.400
What's White Tiger HQ valued at?
You know off the top of your head?

248
00:16:23.480 --> 00:16:29.160
Oh. uh. I'd say it's probably appraised
somewhere around fifty billion or so?

249
00:16:29.240 --> 00:16:32.440
Interesting. then your
entire HQ is the offer?

250
00:16:33.370 --> 00:16:35.570
I'm not sure I'm following you here.

251
00:16:36.080 --> 00:16:37.480
Hm?

252
00:16:39.130 --> 00:16:42.500
What? Thirty billion?

253
00:16:42.580 --> 00:16:44.660
-Why'd he freak out?
-Who knows?

254
00:16:44.940 --> 00:16:46.810
That's the value of the
building I was promised

255
00:16:46.890 --> 00:16:50.430
by Yoojin Construction.
and it keeps going higher.

256
00:16:50.510 --> 00:16:52.720
You said you'd double that.
which is why I figured

257
00:16:52.800 --> 00:16:55.390
a building worth
fifty billion would do.

258
00:16:55.470 --> 00:16:58.500
If you think I'm bluffing.
I've got the proof right here.

259
00:16:59.480 --> 00:17:04.820
W-well. uh. thing is. uh. negotiating
that kind of money is above my pay grade.

260
00:17:04.900 --> 00:17:06.950
I'm sure once I discuss it
with the brass. though...

261
00:17:07.030 --> 00:17:09.410
No need. I believe we're done here.

262
00:17:09.490 --> 00:17:11.780
Huh?

263
00:17:11.860 --> 00:17:13.660
I was too desperate.

264
00:17:13.740 --> 00:17:17.110
I should've looked into his deal
with Yoojin Construction first!

265
00:17:17.870 --> 00:17:19.590
Before I go.

266
00:17:19.670 --> 00:17:22.290
I'm curious how you
found out about me.

267
00:17:22.370 --> 00:17:26.080
It's not because you've been
snooping around. is it?

268
00:17:28.130 --> 00:17:29.660
Where'd he?

269
00:17:35.810 --> 00:17:38.840
Wait. does he have the Stealth skill?

270
00:17:39.520 --> 00:17:41.860
Suddenly that outrageous
offer makes sense!

271
00:17:41.940 --> 00:17:44.940
A reawakened with Stealth
is worth a whole building!

272
00:17:45.020 --> 00:17:46.570
Maybe two!

273
00:17:46.650 --> 00:17:49.660
Sorry. I meant no harm
in researching you.

274
00:17:49.740 --> 00:17:52.490
But. I wouldn't call it
"snooping" per se.

275
00:17:52.570 --> 00:17:54.100
Don't turn around.

276
00:17:55.360 --> 00:17:59.580
There's been a shortage of C-Rank gates.
which has put a stopper on our training.

277
00:17:59.660 --> 00:18:03.000
Our policy is to only send
rookies on raids they can handle.

278
00:18:03.080 --> 00:18:07.550
And so. I was tasked with investigating
who was buying up all of the gates.

279
00:18:07.630 --> 00:18:10.740
when I came across your name.
Hunter Sung.

280
00:18:11.420 --> 00:18:15.570
Apart from yourself. Mister Ahn.
just how many people know about me?

281
00:18:17.730 --> 00:18:20.690
It's only me and one
of my subordinates.

282
00:18:20.770 --> 00:18:24.020
I see. I'd rather
keep a low profile.

283
00:18:24.100 --> 00:18:28.680
If word should get out about me. you
two will be the first people I suspect.

284
00:18:29.320 --> 00:18:31.280
Well. I'm here on
official guild business

285
00:18:31.360 --> 00:18:33.740
so I'm supposed to make
a report to our president.

286
00:18:33.820 --> 00:18:38.670
But I really don't wanna die so. I'll see
to it that we both keep our mouths shut.

287
00:18:38.750 --> 00:18:40.650
I appreciate that.

288
00:18:41.750 --> 00:18:45.330
I never stopped to think monopolizing
the gates would cause trouble.

289
00:18:45.410 --> 00:18:49.470
My turn to say sorry now.
because we are going to continue.

290
00:18:49.550 --> 00:18:51.010
That's a real shame. then.

291
00:18:51.090 --> 00:18:54.300
Our developing hunters are trapped
in a bottleneck without those gates.

292
00:18:54.380 --> 00:18:56.480
Well. we could make a deal.

293
00:18:56.560 --> 00:18:59.480
You would do that?
What's the catch here?

294
00:18:59.560 --> 00:19:03.640
Three of our C-Rank gates can be
claimed by your guild if the price is right.

295
00:19:03.720 --> 00:19:08.200
You won't be raiding C-Rank dungeons
anytime soon if you let this offer slide.

296
00:19:08.280 --> 00:19:11.360
It's like the
home shopping channel. but...

297
00:19:11.440 --> 00:19:14.610
I understand.
how much are you asking?

298
00:19:14.690 --> 00:19:16.370
I want three hundred million apiece.

299
00:19:16.450 --> 00:19:18.140
You... you're joking!

300
00:19:20.870 --> 00:19:23.160
Most we could profit
from C-Rank mana crystals

301
00:19:23.240 --> 00:19:26.470
and essence stones is about two
hundred million and that's on a good day!

302
00:19:26.550 --> 00:19:28.840
If you could lower the price to two
hundred million at least. then I would--

303
00:19:28.920 --> 00:19:31.070
Works for me.

304
00:19:32.130 --> 00:19:34.050
Seems we have ourselves a deal.

305
00:19:34.130 --> 00:19:35.810
Oh... we do.

306
00:19:35.890 --> 00:19:38.230
Which means we'll be taking
three gates off your hands.

307
00:19:38.310 --> 00:19:39.310
Right.

308
00:19:39.390 --> 00:19:42.210
Three gates for a total
of six hundred million.

309
00:19:44.100 --> 00:19:45.960
Okay. deal.

310
00:19:46.770 --> 00:19:49.150
Wire the money here
by the end of the day.

311
00:19:49.230 --> 00:19:52.320
And one last thing. a parting gift.

312
00:19:52.400 --> 00:19:54.280
Close your eyes and open
your mouth. please.

313
00:19:54.360 --> 00:19:55.440
Huh?

314
00:19:55.520 --> 00:19:58.640
I assure you this gift
isn't going to hurt you.

315
00:20:07.210 --> 00:20:09.760
Did my cut just heal?

316
00:20:09.840 --> 00:20:11.530
See ya.

317
00:20:13.920 --> 00:20:16.390
Since you showed me your
stealth and recovery skills.

318
00:20:16.470 --> 00:20:20.390
can I take that as a sign you trust me. or
is that simply wishful thinking on my part?

319
00:20:20.470 --> 00:20:25.410
If you don't go blab my secret.
then yes. Mister Ahn. I'll trust you.

320
00:20:27.690 --> 00:20:29.610
So. how'd it go?

321
00:20:29.690 --> 00:20:31.900
Were you able to scout
a new White Tiger?

322
00:20:31.980 --> 00:20:34.190
No. but. Kichul.

323
00:20:34.270 --> 00:20:38.560
I think that guy is a jackpot bigger
than either of us could ever imagine.

324
00:20:43.780 --> 00:20:45.450
Boss. I confirmed the transfer.

325
00:20:45.530 --> 00:20:47.530
The six hundred mil is really there.

326
00:20:48.500 --> 00:20:50.460
How'd you sell those gates so high?

327
00:20:50.540 --> 00:20:53.130
And right before
we canceled them. too!

328
00:20:53.210 --> 00:20:55.090
Who bought them from you?

329
00:20:55.170 --> 00:20:57.240
Let's call it a trade secret.

330
00:20:58.800 --> 00:21:00.060
What?

331
00:21:00.140 --> 00:21:02.890
There's a ton of C-Rank gates
in our area now?

332
00:21:02.970 --> 00:21:04.010
Uh. yes.

333
00:21:04.090 --> 00:21:06.980
Yoojin Construction only bought
the three we purchased from them!

334
00:21:07.060 --> 00:21:09.270
And the rest are all selling
for seventy million or less.

335
00:21:09.350 --> 00:21:12.090
so it seems Hunter Sung
totally tricked you. sir!

336
00:21:13.690 --> 00:21:17.200
Not only did I fail to recruit
the guy. I let him con me!

337
00:21:17.280 --> 00:21:18.930
What a nightmare!

338
00:21:19.820 --> 00:21:22.680
Guess strength gives people
courage to pull anything!

339
00:21:24.320 --> 00:21:26.980
A message? Am I fired?

340
00:21:27.750 --> 00:21:30.420
This is Jinwoo Sung.
with this. we're even.

341
00:21:30.500 --> 00:21:33.250
I'll forget the fact
that you spied on me.

342
00:21:33.330 --> 00:21:37.350
Oh. okay. Sung.
that's how it is. huh?

343
00:21:37.430 --> 00:21:40.550
Money-wise. you did win.
but at least I earned your trust.

344
00:21:40.630 --> 00:21:42.050
Tricky as you are.

345
00:21:42.130 --> 00:21:44.510
You saying Hunter Sung
sent that message just now?

346
00:21:44.590 --> 00:21:46.480
Yeah.

347
00:21:46.560 --> 00:21:48.650
Though he raked me over the coals.

348
00:21:48.730 --> 00:21:51.460
He gave me his contact info
in the process.

349
00:21:52.730 --> 00:21:56.390
For the time being. I think
I can be satisfied with that.

350
00:21:58.610 --> 00:22:00.410
So a job-change quest.

351
00:22:00.490 --> 00:22:03.300
Well. should be interesting.

352
00:22:04.305 --> 00:23:04.298
Press play. Subtitles appear.
200+ languages. One app:  tryray.app
